{
  "name": "WhatsApp AI Front Desk",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a1",
      "name": "WhatsApp Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET,POST",
        "path": "whatsapp-webhook",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b1",
      "name": "Is Verify Challenge?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.query['hub.mode'] }}",
              "operation": "equal",
              "value2": "subscribe"
            },
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.query['hub.verify_token'] }}",
              "operation": "equal",
              "value2": "={{ $env.VERIFY_TOKEN }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "name": "Echo Challenge",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json.query['hub.challenge'] }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "name": "Extract Sender + Text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "sender",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.entry[0].changes[0].value.messages[0].from }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "text",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.entry[0].changes[0].value.messages[0].text.body }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "message_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.entry[0].changes[0].value.messages[0].id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1",
      "name": "Front Desk Brain",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "complete",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are the AI front desk for a services business. Qualify the visitor: collect name, service needed, urgency. Answer simple FAQs (hours, pricing ranges, location). If the user asks for a human, says 'call me', or you cannot understand them twice, reply with exactly: ESCALATE:<reason>. Keep replies under 40 words, friendly tone."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ $('Extract Sender + Text').item.json.text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "name": "Reply via WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/{{ $env.PHONE_NUMBER_ID }}/messages",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.WHATSAPP_TOKEN }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\"messaging_product\":\"whatsapp\",\"to\":\"{{ $('Extract Sender + Text').item.json.sender }}\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":{\"body\":\"{{ $json.choices[0].message.content }}\"}}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f1",
      "name": "Ack 200",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1340,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "{\"ok\": true}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "name": "Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WhatsApp AI Front Desk (n8n)\n1. **WhatsApp Webhook** \u2014 Meta calls GET (verify) and POST (messages).\n2. **Is Verify Challenge?** \u2014 hub.mode=subscribe + verify token match -> Echo Challenge (returns hub.challenge verbatim).\n3. **Extract Sender + Text** \u2014 pulls from/text/id from entry[0].changes[0].value.messages[0].\n4. **Front Desk Brain** \u2014 OpenAI chat with the front-desk system prompt.\n5. **Reply via WhatsApp** \u2014 HTTP POST to graph.facebook.com/v21.0/<phone_number_id>/messages.\n\n### Credentials plug-in (env vars, never in the workflow)\n- VERIFY_TOKEN -> env on the n8n host (compared in the IF node).\n- WHATSAPP_TOKEN -> n8n HTTP Header Auth: Authorization: Bearer <token>.\n- PHONE_NUMBER_ID -> env var used in the Reply URL.\n- OpenAI -> the n8n OpenAI credential on the Front Desk Brain node.\nKeep the workflow in Test mode while trialling; activate for production."
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "WhatsApp Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Is Verify Challenge?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Is Verify Challenge?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Echo Challenge",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Extract Sender + Text",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Extract Sender + Text": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Front Desk Brain",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Front Desk Brain": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Reply via WhatsApp",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Reply via WhatsApp": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Ack 200",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}